{"version":1,"content":"<p>Take-Two Interactive表示，《俠盜獵車手6》（GTA6）的預購加上首發當日銷售額達到37.9億美元，這不僅創下電子遊戲史上最高首發收入紀錄，也大概率是娛樂史上所有創意作品中規模最大的首發。這場現象級首發展現了遊戲IP在商業、文化以及荷里活層面的巨大價值。<br/></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587382.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.207314+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:58:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_hash":"4dd3eb1476463c0457155c456498dc71f99d396fcd107c53c2297c49bb754742","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}